  "question": {
    "text": "If the shortest distance between the lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is equal to_____.",
    "image": null
  },
